flowchart TB
accTitle: Turn matching log events into a count before evaluating a threshold
accDescr: JSON logs from EC2 and on-premises servers enter CloudWatch Logs. The filter adds one only for ERROR events, and the five-minute sum drives an alarm and SNS notification.
L[EC2 and on-premises JSON logs]:::inputData --> A[CloudWatch agent<br/>Standard log group]:::process
A --> F[Metric filter<br/>ERROR contributes 1]:::process
F --> S[Five-minute metric Sum]:::process
S --> T{Count at least 20?}:::decision
T -->|Alarm state change| N[SNS notification]:::output
T -->|No| O[Continue evaluating]:::reference
